# TBMC — Commission 06A.2: MFCS Right Twin Live Integration

**Project:** TmoGit/TBMC-Deploy  
**Organization:** Acropolis Engineers  
**Target equipment:** BRX5-02-02  
**OPC connection:** MFCS_OPCUA  
**MFCS instrument:** U02 — Biostat B TWIN_R_814  
**Predecessors:** Commission 06A and 06A.1  
**Execution:** Authorized controlled commissioning  
**Design authority:** Existing FAT-approved Ignition application  
**Final disposition:** Leave both equipment instances enabled and live

## 1. Objective

Connect the existing BRX5-02-02 equipment UDT instance to the right BIOSTAT Twin bioreactor through MFCS OPC UA.

Replicate the successful instance-level integration methodology established for BRX5-02-01 during Commission 06A, including the equipment enablement procedure successfully implemented during Commission 06A.1.

Demonstrate end-to-end live data acquisition:

Physical bioreactor → MFCS OPC UA → Existing Ignition UDT → Existing SCADA graphics.

Leave both bioreactors enabled and displaying live process measurements on the existing SCADA overview and detail screens.

Do not redesign the equipment UDTs, equipment hierarchy or SCADA application.

